well, you know about water prayers right?  drop water on coaligned altar,
pray when it's safe to do so, and you get holy water.  New holy water can be
made by taking a stack of regular water and dipping them in a holy water,
the whole stack gets blessed.

As far as impressive items, if you can defeat the castle, there's a wand of
wishing in it, so you can ask for all the things you'll need (at this point,
a form of reflection (probably SDSM) boots of speed, gauntlets of dexterity,
and maybe a helm of brilliance.  magic markers and charging scrolls are also
important, wish for the appropriate one first, just in case the wand only
has one charge.



Oh, and get your level to 14 to do the quest.  I'd do that before you do
much else, since the artifact makes life much easier.  The dark one will
fall to 2-3 fireballs, just make sure to cast them far enough away that you
don't get hit.  Easiest ways to gain levels after about lvl 11 or 12 is to
eat wraith corpses, and quaff !oGain level.

